    <string name="liveprog_help">Write a JamesDSP Liveprog script: @init runs once, @sample once per sample with spl0 and spl1, @slider when a knob moves and @block once per buffer. Declare knobs above the first section, like dB:-6&lt;-24,12,0.5&gt;Gain.</string>
    <string name="liveprog_credit">Liveprog runs JamesDSP\'s EEL2 engine by James Fung, as packaged in JDSP4Linux by Tim Schneeberger (ThePBone). Scripts can\'t open files or folders here.</string>
