    <string name="atmos_streaming_note">Apple encodes Atmos for FairPlay only and Monochrome streams stereo FLAC, so Atmos comes from a module added from a link: set its Dolby Atmos choice to Atmos. Your own surround files are rendered too.</string>
    <string name="quality_module_stream">Stream</string>
    <string name="quality_provider_footnote">Tap YouTube Music to turn it on or off, or a module to open its page. Drag a handle to change the order: each song plays from the first one that\'s on and has it. Modules you\'ve switched off aren\'t listed here.</string>
    <string name="quality_download_footnote">How songs downloaded from YouTube are saved, from now on. Downloads already made stay as they are.</string>
    <string name="quality_download_order">Download order</string>
    <string name="quality_download_order_youtube">Downloads what the others can\'t</string>
    <string name="quality_download_order_footnote">Each download comes from the first provider here that has the song as one whole file. Streams that come in pieces, or that need a license, are skipped. YouTube is always here for downloads, even when it\'s off for playing.</string>
